<title>UK: Rubicon H1 EPS rises 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Rubicon H1 EPS rises 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.2		    vs 6.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.2		    vs 2.2</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    8.04		   vs 2.84</p>
<p> Turnover		   119.7		  vs 47.43</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British engineering group is Rubicon Group Plc.</p>
